{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語\n阿閦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翠巖芝禪師註曰：此敘宗旨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘馬祖宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘\n洞上宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘石霜宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘溈仰宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘石頭、藥山宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘雪峰、\n地藏宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘雲門宗派\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此敘德山、臨濟宗派也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子曇彬序"}
{"id": null, "n": "0445001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0445001", "type": "orig", "text": "超或逍乎"}
